5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know how the money works so nobody gets stuck with extra costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the total cost before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious about how the space affects our time together.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am worried about how much time is lost just getting there.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to know if there is a quiet place to sit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we know the total, we can split it fairly, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, a single bill is easier to manage than surprises.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. I also want to see how the rooms are set up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,The travel time is the main issue for me.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will look into the bathroom situation too.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
