18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the ferry sailings and train time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the bathing hours and bathroom provision.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I will also check what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
