35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that renting a whole house is about 5,400 yen a head a night.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The valley inn is 17,000 yen with meals included. That is a fixed cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that in the shared house, we had no space to be alone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two days of travel. The train to the spa is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, the island house bill is one total, so it divides evenly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, but the city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 plus meals. That is unpredictable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,I also found that last year we barely saw each other during the day.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"The city trains are frequent, but the spa bus stops early.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn has fixed meal times. Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I prefer the island house because the cost is clear and shared.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. The fixed rate of the inn is also good, but the city is risky.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I worry about the island house being too crowded. We need space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The train to the spa is much faster. I prefer that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the one bathroom on the island. It might be stressful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, we can take turns. It is a small house, but we are friends.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,The all-in rate means I know exactly what I pay. That is important to me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I think the spa town offers a balance. We are together, but have some space.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The spa town is efficient. We lose less time travelling.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"The city room has a door. That is nice, but the cost is high.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
