60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of the island. We are all in one place.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The cost is the most predictable for the island. I am leaning that way.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,I am still concerned about the lack of private space on the island.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The travel time for the island is too long. I prefer the spa town.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the bathroom on the island. The spa town has baths.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Midori, we can go out to the shops if we need space.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"The spa town is also a fixed cost, but the island is one bill.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,The spa town allows us to be together but also have some independence.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The train is much better than the ferry. I am voting for the spa town.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The fixed meal times at the inn might be hard, but the baths are good.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I will vote for the island. The shared cost is important to me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I will vote for the island. The financial clarity is what I need.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I will vote for the spa town. I think it balances togetherness and space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for the spa town. The travel time is acceptable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for the spa town. The bathroom situation is better.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope we can make the island work. It feels like a real trip.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I understand the concerns, but the cost certainty is hard to beat.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I think the spa town will be more comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Midori. The efficiency is key.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am a bit nervous, but the spa town seems safer for me.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
